    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/f8f539aeae019310fc5bab2582819e58.poster.avif?t=1751460615\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/f8f539aeae019310fc5bab2582819e58.webm?t=1751460615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong>O3 - Hollow Descent</strong>, a bullet-hell roguelike shooter set in a surreal universe inspired by the haunting art of H.R. Giger and Zdzis\u0142aw Beksi\u0144ski. As a lone astronaut stranded on a hostile planet, navigate ever-changing rooms filled with deadly traps and malevolent creatures. Uncover ancient ruins, confront intelligent life forms, and unravel the mysteries that lie within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/24653d9588653e09cb623f66a84cc16d.poster.avif?t=1751460615\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/24653d9588653e09cb623f66a84cc16d.webm?t=1751460615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/24653d9588653e09cb623f66a84cc16d.mp4?t=1751460615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/8eb3028a4b10548f3704571f6c1da57c.webp?t=1751460615\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The depths shift and reshape. Traverse ever-changing corridors, evade deadly traps, and fight to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/f738f98da17d625ace928020535c5b54.poster.avif?t=1751460615\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/f738f98da17d625ace928020535c5b54.webm?t=1751460615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/f738f98da17d625ace928020535c5b54.mp4?t=1751460615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/7dea648af91537ea9b69af5e3ad60561.webp?t=1751460615\" /></span>The dungeon is relentless. Dash through waves of destruction, unleash devastating weapons, and carve a path through the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/daedacf4320ec27d458ff5203d0efc77.poster.avif?t=1751460615\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/daedacf4320ec27d458ff5203d0efc77.webm?t=1751460615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/daedacf4320ec27d458ff5203d0efc77.mp4?t=1751460615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/8f059cc62fa452ca625e04178017a5eb.webp?t=1751460615\" /></span>Uncover the unseen and step beyond the veil. Reveal hidden rooms, open abyssal chests, and exchange remnants for powerful upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/32bdfcc5db5fba39fb86615b1731b09a.poster.avif?t=1751460615\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/32bdfcc5db5fba39fb86615b1731b09a.webm?t=1751460615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/32bdfcc5db5fba39fb86615b1731b09a.mp4?t=1751460615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
